# 6. AUTHENTICATION VS AUTHORIZATION

This is one of the most important exam concepts.

### Authentication

> **Who are you?**

Examples:

```text
Username + Password
MFA
Certificate
Passkey
```

### Authorization

> **What are you allowed to do?**

Example:

```text
Normal User → View own profile
Admin       → Manage users
```

### Memory

> **AuthN = Identity**

> **AuthZ = Permission**

