# 7. BROKEN ACCESS CONTROL

Example:

```text
User A
  ↓
/profile/123
```

User changes the identifier and accesses another user's resource without authorization.

This can indicate an **IDOR / broken access control** issue.

### Important

The server must enforce authorization.

Never trust:

```text
Hidden buttons
Client-side checks
URL obscurity
Hidden fields
```

