# 8. SQL INJECTION REVISION

## Definition

> SQL Injection occurs when untrusted input is improperly incorporated into SQL and changes the intended query behavior.

---

## Common Locations

```text
Login
Search
Forms
URL parameters
API parameters
Filters
Admin interfaces
```

---

## Types

```text
In-band
Blind
Out-of-band
```

Blind SQLi commonly includes:

```text
Boolean-based
Time-based
```

---

# 9. SQLi PRIMARY DEFENSE

### Unsafe concept

```python
query = "SELECT * FROM users WHERE name = '" + username + "'"
```

### Safer approach

```python
query = "SELECT * FROM users WHERE name = ?"
cursor.execute(query, (username,))
```

The key principle is:

> **Keep SQL code separate from user-supplied data.**

