# 14. DANGEROUS DOM SINKS

Examples:

```javascript
innerHTML
outerHTML
document.write()
insertAdjacentHTML()
```

Prefer safe text handling where appropriate:

```javascript
textContent
```

### Important

Frameworks such as React may automatically escape content, but unsafe raw-HTML features can reintroduce XSS risk.

