# 26. FALSE POSITIVE VS FALSE NEGATIVE

### False Positive

Scanner says vulnerability exists:

```text
Scanner → Vulnerable
Reality → Not vulnerable
```

### False Negative

Scanner says nothing:

```text
Scanner → No finding
Reality → Vulnerability exists
```

### Memory

> **Positive = Scanner says YES**

> **Negative = Scanner says NO**

