# 🏆 DAY 28 MASTER CHECKPOINT

If you remember only this:

```text
SQLi
→ Parameterized Queries

XSS
→ Output Encoding

Traversal
→ Canonicalize + Controlled File IDs

CSRF
→ CSRF Token + SameSite + Origin Validation

Access Control
→ Server-side Authorization

Scanner
→ Finds POTENTIAL issues

Validation
→ Confirms REAL issues

Report
→ Evidence + Impact + Fix

Retest
→ Verify the fix
```

## Golden Rule

> **Never confuse detection with exploitation, and never confuse a scanner finding with a confirmed vulnerability. Test only within explicit authorization and scope.**